    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Witch</strong> is a bullet hell metroidvania where you shoot, dodge, and fly using powerful spells. Explore the ruins of a mana-infested mining town, left in chaos after a catastrophic magical incident. Master your magic, conquer the chaos, and uncover the secrets buried beneath the rubble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457170/extras/7bc184a71efa14946481f24f7e77245d.poster.avif?t=1744667890\" width=800 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457170/extras/7bc184a71efa14946481f24f7e77245d.webm?t=1744667890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457170/extras/7bc184a71efa14946481f24f7e77245d.mp4?t=1744667890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot in all directions, dodge like crazy, and master your magic. A metroidvania for spell-slingers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457170/extras/dd419f6f5b45588df56ec32b0f946e9c.poster.avif?t=1744667890\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457170/extras/dd419f6f5b45588df56ec32b0f946e9c.webm?t=1744667890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457170/extras/dd419f6f5b45588df56ec32b0f946e9c.mp4?t=1744667890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed is survival. Master fast, fluid movement in an ever-changing world full of magic, enemies, and unstable terrain.</p>",
